019	PSA	022	018	Bagabana engoye zange; era ekyambalo kyange bakikubira akalulu.
019	PSA	022	019	Naye ggwe, Ayi Mukama, tobeera wala nange. Ggwe, Amaanyi gange, yanguwa okunnyamba!
