019	PSA	025	006	Jjukira, Ayi Mukama, okusaasira kwo okunene, n’okwagala kwo okungi, kubanga byava dda.
019	PSA	025	007	Tojjukira bibi byange n’obujeemu bwange eby’omu buvubuka bwange. Onzijukire, Ayi Mukama, ng’okwagala kwo gye ndi bwe kuli, kubanga oli mulungi.
019	PSA	025	008	Mukama mulungi, era wa mazima, noolwekyo ayigiriza aboonoonyi ekkubo lye.
019	PSA	025	009	Abawombeefu abaluŋŋamya mu kkubo ettuufu n’abayigiriza ekkubo lye.
