# BOOK	022	SOL	Song of Solomon	Oluyimba
022	SOL	001	001	Oluyimba lwa Sulemaani olusinga ennyimba zonna.
022	SOL	001	002	Leka annywegere n’emimwa gye kubanga okwagala kwo kusinga envinnyo,
