048	GAL	002	017	Naye oba nga bwe twanoonya okuweebwa obutuukirivu mu Kristo twasangibwa okuba aboonoonyi, kitegeeza nti Kristo muweereza wa kibi? Kikafuuwe.
048	GAL	002	018	Kubanga bwe nzimba nate bye nazikiriza, nneeraga nzekka okuba omwonoonyi.
048	GAL	002	019	Kubanga olw’amateeka nnafa eri mateeka, ndyoke mbeere omulamu mu Katonda. Nakomererwa wamu ne Kristo;
